# PolyPulse smoke tests

Run from the extracted package root:

```bash
blender --background --factory-startup --python tests/polypulse_smoke_tests.py
```

The test creates a disposable scene and runs every registered operator with an
execute path, including all collider variants and all three exporters. It does
not replace visual QA: check the generated FBX/GLB, UV layout, viewport overlay,
and panels manually in Blender 3.6 LTS and 4.3+.

Set `POLYPULSE_TEST_REPORT=/path/report.json` to choose the JSON report path.
